            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cook-N-Now"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I followed the other notes and used the cocoa powder I had on hand. I also used cane sugar because I don’t use white. I used almond milk in place of whole. It tastes great. Just the right amount of sweetness and mint. I’ll definitely be using this recipe again.",
